            "title": "ABOUT US",
            "content": "<p>Just as a poet selects words for their beauty and sound and arranges them to<br/>tell a story, we believe your home tells a story, through the objects and<br/>elements that are arranged together in a space. Welcome to Poeme Home,<br/>where design is the essence of storytelling.<br/><br/>We are a boutique destination for beautiful design, offering a curated<br/>collection of unique products designed both in house and sourced from<br/>across the globe, to provide an elevated sense of style to the story of your<br/>home. With an emphasis on objects of beauty, refined luxury and enduring<br/>style, our aim is to bring you designs that offer luxurious materials, rich<br/>textures and harmonious colour palettes that will bring joy to your everyday.<br/><br/>We hope you enjoy exploring the beauty and elegance on offer at Poeme<br/>Home and we welcome you into our world. xx</p>",
